== B5  Lorentz algebra of step 3
PASS B5a  [identity] (1+w0)^2 = r and (1-w0)^2 = r have the unique solution w0 = 0, r = 1: [{r: 1, w0: 0}]
PASS B5b  [identity] the pairing of (t, v) with (t, -v) is t^2 - |v|^2 (zero exactly on null vectors)

